name four-4v4-asym-1
timeout 700

# THE FOUR-SHIP, and the only file in the tree in which the sort has more than one degree of freedom:
# four shooters against four contacts is a real ASSIGNMENT problem rather than "he takes the other
# one". It is pair-2v2-asym.fbm scaled up, same geometry, same doctrine on both sides.
#
# WHAT THE STATIONS ARE. A flight is decomposed into ELEMENTS of two (doc/formation.md section 4.2):
# position 1 is the reference, 2 sits one spread to its right, and the second element (3 and 4) sits
# two spreads to its LEFT with 4 tucked inside 3. Every position carries its own altitude step, so no
# two aircraft in a flight are co-altitude. Each unit below spawns ON its own station, which is why
# the lat/alt of the four blocks per side are what they are.
#
# READING RULE: exit 3 (TIMEOUT) or a decided side; either is a result. What is measured is whether
# the SORT still holds with four:
#   flt_dup & flt_free   a target shared while another was free — must stay 0 across all eight units
#   flt_assign           four distinct values across the F-16 flight is a clean four-way split
#   flt_switch           re-sorts. Four members re-sort more than two, and how much more is the number
#   flt_both_s           how much of the fight the MiG flight spent with nobody free
# and the same eng_*/dmg_* channels every duel carries.
#
# MEASURED (exit 3): distinct targets per engaged member — viper flight 0.962, fulcrum flight 0.750.
# One in four contract shooters is on a target its own flight already has; the cooperative flight is
# within 4 % of one target each. `dup && free` is 0 for all eight units. Four F-16 rounds arrive on
# three distinct MiGs, four MiG rounds on two distinct F-16s with viper1 taking three of them.

unit viper1
  team friendly
  flight viper 1
  module f16
  spawn 46.90000 6.40000 8000 90.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 70
  set datalink on
  set fcr_mode crm
  set fcr_range_nm 40
  set rwr on
  set store 3 aim120
  set store 7 aim120
  set cmds_mode man
  set cmds_program 1
  set cmds_chaff 60
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task intercept
  wp 46.90000 8.40000 8000 450
  objective kill team hostile
  objective survive

